/*--------------------------------------------------------------------
 * D3DFVF_TEXCOORDSIZEn  [macro]
 * surface: ce-only
 * library: -
 * versions: 4.0..499
 * source: corpus/learn/windows-ce-net-4x/ms886245(v=msdn.10).html
